<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Happy Birthday Mumma ❤️</title>

<style>
body{
margin:0;
overflow:hidden;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffd6e7,#fff5f8);
text-align:center;
}

.container{
padding-top:60px;
}

h1{
color:#ff4081;
font-size:50px;
}

p{
font-size:22px;
color:#555;
padding:0 20px;
}

button{
background:#ff4081;
color:white;
border:none;
padding:15px 30px;
font-size:20px;
border-radius:30px;
cursor:pointer;
margin-top:20px;
}

.heart,.confetti{
position:absolute;
pointer-events:none;
}

.heart{
font-size:24px;
animation:float 8s linear infinite;
}

.confetti{
font-size:22px;
animation:fall 5s linear infinite;
}

@keyframes float{
from{transform:translateY(100vh);}
to{transform:translateY(-100px);}
}

@keyframes fall{
from{transform:translateY(-50px);}
to{transform:translateY(100vh);}
}

#letter{
display:none;
max-width:700px;
margin:30px auto;
background:white;
padding:25px;
border-radius:20px;
box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<h1>🎂 Happy Birthday Mumma 🎂</h1>

<p>
💖 Dear Mumma 💖<br><br>

Aaj ka din bahut special hai,<br>
kyunki aaj meri duniya ki sabse pyari Mumma ka birthday hai 🥹🌹<br><br>

Thank you for everything Ammi ❤️<br>
Aapne mere liye jo kuch kiya hai uska shukriya lafzon me bayan nahi kar sakti 💕<br><br>

I Love You So Much Mumma 💞
</p>

<button onclick="openGift()">🎁 Open Your Surprise Gift</button>

<div id="letter">
<h2>💌 A Letter For Mumma 💌</h2>

<p>
My Dearest Mumma ❤️<br><br>

Thank you for this beautiful surprise 🥹💖<br>

Meri pyari badi beti Al Haadi,<br>
tumhara yeh pyaar aur yeh surprise mere liye duniya ka sabse khoobsurat gift hai 🌹✨<br><br>

Main tum par bahut fakhr karti hoon ❤️<br>
Allah tumhe hamesha khush rakhe, kamyab kare aur tumhare har sapne poore kare 🤲💞<br><br>

Lots of Love,<br>
💖 Mumma 💖
</p>
</div>

</div>

<script>
function openGift(){
document.getElementById("letter").style.display="block";
window.scrollTo({
top:document.body.scrollHeight,
behavior:"smooth"
});
}

for(let i=0;i<40;i++){
let h=document.createElement("div");
h.className="heart";
h.innerHTML="💖";
h.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";
h.style.animationDuration=(Math.random()*5+5)+"s";
document.body.appendChild(h);
}

const items=["🎊","🎉","✨","🎀","🌸"];

for(let i=0;i<40;i++){
let c=document.createElement("div");
c.className="confetti";
c.innerHTML=items[Math.floor(Math.random()*items.length)];
c.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";
c.style.animationDuration=(Math.random()*4+3)+"s";
document.body.appendChild(c);
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
